    "naming_rule": "ONE name per holy site, selected by building type: a celestial hall (Miao, Jiin) takes the power's .celestial face; a kami-shrine (Miya, Jinja) takes its .kami face. The namer reads one field and formats '[building] of [face]' - identical cost to any single-pantheon culture. NEVER emit both faces in one name. The honji-suijaku identity (the two faces are one power) is surfaced in lore/dialogue text, not in proper names.",
    "religious_orders_pattern": "ONE face per site by building type (see naming_rule): celestial hall -> 'the Jiin of Tuli-di', 'the Miao of Gaidun-di'; kami-shrine -> 'the Miya of Terashi-no-kami', 'the Jinja of Iwane-no-kami'. Both kinds occur across a realm; each name carries a single face.",
    "saints_pattern": "deified sages, dragon-kings and ancestral heroes; named with the single face matching their site (celestial hall or kami-shrine).",
